    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468090/extras/f84f2f4d653eed2bcb947c1e5d79ff35.avif?t=1738008880\" data-has-big width=800 height=1062 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various worlds in a hack-and-slash action game - In a world ravaged by an unknown disaster, face various monsters with the diverse weapons you find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468090/extras/8405f2cb42a402325fa45408910c982e.avif?t=1738008880\" data-has-big width=800 height=1422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0eExplore the post apocalyptic world and take on powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0eThe \u201cWorld Class\u201d bosses are so huge that they cover the entire world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0eDifferentiated weapons with built-in transformations and gimmicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0eFind your own play style by using spiritual devices that allow you to perform a variety of skills such as emergency dodging, firing wires, riding robots, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0eTravel from town to town in a mysterious world created by a disaster of unknown origin. Explore a fantastical world created by people's memories.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468090/extras/f84f2f4d653eed2bcb947c1e5d79ff35.avif?t=1738008880\" data-has-big width=800 height=1062 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various worlds in a hack-and-slash action game - In a world ravaged by an unknown disaster, face various monsters with the diverse weapons you find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468090/extras/8405f2cb42a402325fa45408910c982e.avif?t=1738008880\" data-has-big width=800 height=1422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0eExplore the post apocalyptic world and take on powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0eThe \u201cWorld Class\u201d bosses are so huge that they cover the entire world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0eDifferentiated weapons with built-in transformations and gimmicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0eFind your own play style by using spiritual devices that allow you to perform a variety of skills such as emergency dodging, firing wires, riding robots, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa\ufe0eTravel from town to town in a mysterious world created by a disaster of unknown origin. Explore a fantastical world created by people's memories.</p>",
